<code>assert index >= 0 && index < \old(this.size()) && role != null => \forall int i; index < i && i < this.size(); (this.get(i) == null) == (\old(this.get(i)) == null) && (this.get(i) != null) => this.get(i).equals(\old(this.get(i)));</code>
